  "duration_s": 402.332948,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了。第十到第六，朝歌变祁县陈仓变宝鸡常山变石家庄琅琊变临沂，兰陵变枣庄。好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了，有人说金陵呢幽州呢？炒陵呢？别急，今天这集就是第五道第一，一个比一个让人心疼。最后那个三千多年了名字，一个字没动过，见过老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第五名金陵改南京金陵这两个字听着就跪气。孙权在这儿建都叫建业，东晋在这建都都建权。南唐在这儿建都叫江陵，朱元璋在这建都叫应天，可最早早建名最好听的还是金陵。金陵十二钗说的就是南京秦淮河从城中间流过，讲生登迎礼，藏着半部中国史。可后来金陵改成了南京南边的京城，名字是大了，可金陵那个味道没了。您说这是升格还是降格？第四名，幽州改北京幽州这两个字念出来就带着一股边塞的苍凉。幽州是古代九州之一，从汉朝到唐朝，幽州一直是北方的军事重镇。安史之乱，安禄山就是从幽州起兵的幽州，在唐朝的时候管着今天的北京、天津、河北北部，是中原王朝的北大门。可后来幽州改了，改成什么了？北京北边的京城明清两朝在这儿建都，现在更是首都名字是大了，可幽州那个铁马秋风的味道没了，您说这是改名还是改命？第三名，广陵改扬州，广陵这两个字念出来就带着文人的风骨。广陵是汉朝时候的郡，管着今天的扬州广灵王是汉朝最尊贵的封号之一。广陵散是中国十大古琴曲之一。嵇康临死前谈的就是广陵散，广陵这两个字就是魏晋风度的代名词。可后来广陵改了改成扬州。扬州是古代九州之一，名字没错，可广陵那个味道没了。您说这是改地名还是改气质？第二名，姑苏改苏州。姑苏这两个字，念出来，就带着江南的温柔。姑苏城外寒山寺，夜半钟声到客船。张继写的姑苏是吴国的都城，使越王勾践卧薪尝胆的地方，是范蠡带着西施泛舟五湖的起点。姑苏这两个字就是江南的魂，可后来姑苏改了，改成苏州苏州名字。没错，可姑苏那个味道没了，您说这是改名还是改梦？我前阵子翻到一本叫中华文化常识一千问的书。这本书把中国历史上的文化常识分门别类，讲的清清楚楚。从三皇五帝到明清，从政治经济到科技文化，一千个问题一千个答案，咱们这几集讲的这些地名以前叫什么？现在叫什么？为什么改的书里都有他不是那种干巴巴的教科书，是一问一答的形式。翻到哪一页，看哪页，特别适合中老年朋友。每天翻两页。一年下来，中国历史的基本脉络心里全有谱了。我已经放下面了，点开就能看到喜欢历史的朋友，弄一本放床头，随手翻一页就是一段历史。第一名，邯郸等等。邯郸没改名吗？对，邯郸没改名。中国历史上只有邯郸从建成到现在三千一百年了，名字一个字没动过。为什么邯郸能不改名？因为他的名字太特别了。邯郸两个字拆开看寒是寒山，单是尽头的意思，邯郸就是邯山的尽头。战国时期邯郸是赵国的都城秦始皇嬴政。就出生在邯郸，邯郸学步完璧归赵负荆请罪纸上谈兵。这些成语全跟邯郸有关。跟邯郸有关的成语有三千多条，全国第一，三千一百年改朝换代多少回邯郸还是邯郸？别的城市改名是因为新朝代要新气象。邯陈单没改，是因为他的名字刻在成语里，刻在历史里，刻在每个中国人的记忆里。名字没改，地位没降，位置没挪，就这一个，您说这个第一名服不服？您听出来了没有？这十个地名没有一个是随便改的。朝歌改旗县是因为境内有条齐河陈仓改宝鸡，是因为唐玄宗做了一个梦。常山改石家庄是因为石家庄村琅琊改临沂，是因为靠近颐和兰陵改枣庄是因为附近有枣庄煤矿，金陵改南京是为了区分南北幽州，改北京是为了突出北方的京城。广陵改扬州是因为古代九州。姑苏改苏州是因为姑苏山只有邯郸三千一百年没改过，每一个地名都是一段历史，改了就断了，点个关注，咱们下期接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 670,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00002",
      "start_ms": 670,
      "end_ms": 1310,
      "text": "咱们盘了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1310,
      "end_ms": 2610,
      "text": "第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3110,
      "end_ms": 9970,
      "text": "朝歌变祁县陈仓变宝鸡常山变石家庄琅琊变临沂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10310,
      "end_ms": 11710,
      "text": "兰陵变枣庄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12650,
      "end_ms": 15310,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区吵翻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15830,
      "end_ms": 19130,
      "text": "有人说金陵呢幽州呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19270,
      "end_ms": 20090,
      "text": "炒陵呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00009",
      "start_ms": 20870,
      "end_ms": 21350,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21670,
      "end_ms": 23630,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00011",
      "start_ms": 24030,
      "end_ms": 25590,
      "text": "一个比一个让人心疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00012",
      "start_ms": 26590,
      "end_ms": 29170,
      "text": "最后那个三千多年了名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29170,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "一个字没动过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 34720,
      "text": "见过老规矩开讲之前麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34720,
      "end_ms": 42760,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第五名金陵改南京金陵这两个字听着就跪气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00016",
      "start_ms": 43640,
      "end_ms": 47700,
      "text": "孙权在这儿建都叫建业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47800,
      "end_ms": 51340,
      "text": "东晋在这建都都建权。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00018",
      "start_ms": 51780,
      "end_ms": 54540,
      "text": "南唐在这儿建都叫江陵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00019",
      "start_ms": 55120,
      "end_ms": 57460,
      "text": "朱元璋在这建都叫应天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00020",
      "start_ms": 57540,
      "end_ms": 62165,
      "text": "可最早早建名最好听的还是金陵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00021",
      "start_ms": 62950,
      "end_ms": 69365,
      "text": "金陵十二钗说的就是南京秦淮河从城中间流过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00022",
      "start_ms": 69790,
      "end_ms": 71095,
      "text": "讲生登迎礼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00023",
      "start_ms": 71480,
      "end_ms": 73275,
      "text": "藏着半部中国史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00024",
      "start_ms": 73870,
      "end_ms": 77405,
      "text": "可后来金陵改成了南京南边的京城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00025",
      "start_ms": 77930,
      "end_ms": 78930,
      "text": "名字是大了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00026",
      "start_ms": 78990,
      "end_ms": 81110,
      "text": "可金陵那个味道没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00027",
      "start_ms": 81210,
      "end_ms": 83655,
      "text": "您说这是升格还是降格？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00028",
      "start_ms": 84530,
      "end_ms": 85165,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00029",
      "start_ms": 85560,
      "end_ms": 91865,
      "text": "幽州改北京幽州这两个字念出来就带着一股边塞的苍凉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00030",
      "start_ms": 92430,
      "end_ms": 94185,
      "text": "幽州是古代九州之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00031",
      "start_ms": 94430,
      "end_ms": 95950,
      "text": "从汉朝到唐朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00032",
      "start_ms": 96290,
      "end_ms": 99085,
      "text": "幽州一直是北方的军事重镇。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00033",
      "start_ms": 99820,
      "end_ms": 100675,
      "text": "安史之乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00034",
      "start_ms": 101000,
      "end_ms": 104200,
      "text": "安禄山就是从幽州起兵的幽州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00035",
      "start_ms": 104200,
      "end_ms": 109585,
      "text": "在唐朝的时候管着今天的北京、天津、河北北部，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00036",
      "start_ms": 109940,
      "end_ms": 111985,
      "text": "是中原王朝的北大门。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00037",
      "start_ms": 112910,
      "end_ms": 114690,
      "text": "可后来幽州改了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00038",
      "start_ms": 114830,
      "end_ms": 115850,
      "text": "改成什么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00039",
      "start_ms": 115890,
      "end_ms": 120905,
      "text": "北京北边的京城明清两朝在这儿建都，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00040",
      "start_ms": 121460,
      "end_ms": 124245,
      "text": "现在更是首都名字是大了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00041",
      "start_ms": 124950,
      "end_ms": 128000,
      "text": "可幽州那个铁马秋风的味道没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00042",
      "start_ms": 128180,
      "end_ms": 130805,
      "text": "您说这是改名还是改命？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00043",
      "start_ms": 131490,
      "end_ms": 132185,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00044",
      "start_ms": 132500,
      "end_ms": 134205,
      "text": "广陵改扬州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00045",
      "start_ms": 135670,
      "end_ms": 140515,
      "text": "广陵这两个字念出来就带着文人的风骨。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00046",
      "start_ms": 141570,
      "end_ms": 143845,
      "text": "广陵是汉朝时候的郡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00047",
      "start_ms": 144170,
      "end_ms": 149855,
      "text": "管着今天的扬州广灵王是汉朝最尊贵的封号之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00048",
      "start_ms": 150800,
      "end_ms": 154015,
      "text": "广陵散是中国十大古琴曲之一。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00049",
      "start_ms": 154640,
      "end_ms": 157800,
      "text": "嵇康临死前谈的就是广陵散，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00050",
      "start_ms": 157940,
      "end_ms": 161835,
      "text": "广陵这两个字就是魏晋风度的代名词。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00051",
      "start_ms": 162360,
      "end_ms": 165105,
      "text": "可后来广陵改了改成扬州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00052",
      "start_ms": 165770,
      "end_ms": 167935,
      "text": "扬州是古代九州之一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00053",
      "start_ms": 168240,
      "end_ms": 169020,
      "text": "名字没错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00054",
      "start_ms": 169280,
      "end_ms": 171670,
      "text": "可广陵那个味道没了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00055",
      "start_ms": 171770,
      "end_ms": 174105,
      "text": "您说这是改地名还是改气质？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00056",
      "start_ms": 174650,
      "end_ms": 175270,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00057",
      "start_ms": 175510,
      "end_ms": 176575,
      "text": "姑苏改苏州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00058",
      "start_ms": 176810,
      "end_ms": 178780,
      "text": "姑苏这两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00059",
      "start_ms": 179000,
      "end_ms": 179680,
      "text": "念出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00060",
      "start_ms": 179680,
      "end_ms": 181535,
      "text": "就带着江南的温柔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00061",
      "start_ms": 181940,
      "end_ms": 183965,
      "text": "姑苏城外寒山寺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00062",
      "start_ms": 184400,
      "end_ms": 186310,
      "text": "夜半钟声到客船。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00063",
      "start_ms": 186590,
      "end_ms": 190025,
      "text": "张继写的姑苏是吴国的都城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00064",
      "start_ms": 190350,
      "end_ms": 193055,
      "text": "使越王勾践卧薪尝胆的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00065",
      "start_ms": 193390,
      "end_ms": 196500,
      "text": "是范蠡带着西施泛舟五湖的起点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00066",
      "start_ms": 196640,
      "end_ms": 199385,
      "text": "姑苏这两个字就是江南的魂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00067",
      "start_ms": 200270,
      "end_ms": 202565,
      "text": "可后来姑苏改了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00068",
      "start_ms": 203090,
      "end_ms": 205740,
      "text": "改成苏州苏州名字。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00069",
      "start_ms": 205740,
      "end_ms": 206265,
      "text": "没错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00070",
      "start_ms": 206970,
      "end_ms": 209255,
      "text": "可姑苏那个味道没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00071",
      "start_ms": 209500,
      "end_ms": 211875,
      "text": "您说这是改名还是改梦？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00072",
      "start_ms": 212510,
      "end_ms": 217875,
      "text": "我前阵子翻到一本叫中华文化常识一千问的书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00073",
      "start_ms": 218770,
      "end_ms": 223395,
      "text": "这本书把中国历史上的文化常识分门别类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00074",
      "start_ms": 223690,
      "end_ms": 225005,
      "text": "讲的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00075",
      "start_ms": 226070,
      "end_ms": 227965,
      "text": "从三皇五帝到明清，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00076",
      "start_ms": 228310,
      "end_ms": 230855,
      "text": "从政治经济到科技文化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00077",
      "start_ms": 231220,
      "end_ms": 233415,
      "text": "一千个问题一千个答案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00078",
      "start_ms": 233690,
      "end_ms": 237355,
      "text": "咱们这几集讲的这些地名以前叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00079",
      "start_ms": 237660,
      "end_ms": 238635,
      "text": "现在叫什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00080",
      "start_ms": 239050,
      "end_ms": 244085,
      "text": "为什么改的书里都有他不是那种干巴巴的教科书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00081",
      "start_ms": 244610,
      "end_ms": 246665,
      "text": "是一问一答的形式。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00082",
      "start_ms": 247060,
      "end_ms": 248000,
      "text": "翻到哪一页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00083",
      "start_ms": 248000,
      "end_ms": 248675,
      "text": "看哪页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00084",
      "start_ms": 249550,
      "end_ms": 251295,
      "text": "特别适合中老年朋友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00085",
      "start_ms": 251700,
      "end_ms": 253135,
      "text": "每天翻两页。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00086",
      "start_ms": 253530,
      "end_ms": 254595,
      "text": "一年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00087",
      "start_ms": 254920,
      "end_ms": 258645,
      "text": "中国历史的基本脉络心里全有谱了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00088",
      "start_ms": 259170,
      "end_ms": 260545,
      "text": "我已经放下面了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00089",
      "start_ms": 260840,
      "end_ms": 263725,
      "text": "点开就能看到喜欢历史的朋友，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00090",
      "start_ms": 263950,
      "end_ms": 265165,
      "text": "弄一本放床头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00091",
      "start_ms": 265850,
      "end_ms": 268445,
      "text": "随手翻一页就是一段历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00092",
      "start_ms": 268830,
      "end_ms": 269375,
      "text": "第一名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00093",
      "start_ms": 269590,
      "end_ms": 271680,
      "text": "邯郸等等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00094",
      "start_ms": 272530,
      "end_ms": 273690,
      "text": "邯郸没改名吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00095",
      "start_ms": 273710,
      "end_ms": 273950,
      "text": "对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00096",
      "start_ms": 274250,
      "end_ms": 275505,
      "text": "邯郸没改名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00097",
      "start_ms": 276120,
      "end_ms": 281825,
      "text": "中国历史上只有邯郸从建成到现在三千一百年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00098",
      "start_ms": 282170,
      "end_ms": 283765,
      "text": "名字一个字没动过。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00099",
      "start_ms": 284530,
      "end_ms": 286175,
      "text": "为什么邯郸能不改名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00100",
      "start_ms": 287020,
      "end_ms": 290195,
      "text": "因为他的名字太特别了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00101",
      "start_ms": 290720,
      "end_ms": 294040,
      "text": "邯郸两个字拆开看寒是寒山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00102",
      "start_ms": 294300,
      "end_ms": 295795,
      "text": "单是尽头的意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00103",
      "start_ms": 296670,
      "end_ms": 299035,
      "text": "邯郸就是邯山的尽头。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00104",
      "start_ms": 300010,
      "end_ms": 304695,
      "text": "战国时期邯郸是赵国的都城秦始皇嬴政。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00105",
      "start_ms": 305400,
      "end_ms": 306780,
      "text": "就出生在邯郸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00106",
      "start_ms": 307160,
      "end_ms": 312780,
      "text": "邯郸学步完璧归赵负荆请罪纸上谈兵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00107",
      "start_ms": 313319,
      "end_ms": 316000,
      "text": "这些成语全跟邯郸有关。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00108",
      "start_ms": 316840,
      "end_ms": 320600,
      "text": "跟邯郸有关的成语有三千多条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00109",
      "start_ms": 321560,
      "end_ms": 322520,
      "text": "全国第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00110",
      "start_ms": 322760,
      "end_ms": 328800,
      "text": "三千一百年改朝换代多少回邯郸还是邯郸？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00111",
      "start_ms": 328940,
      "end_ms": 333900,
      "text": "别的城市改名是因为新朝代要新气象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00112",
      "start_ms": 334740,
      "end_ms": 335970,
      "text": "邯陈单没改，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00113",
      "start_ms": 336310,
      "end_ms": 339370,
      "text": "是因为他的名字刻在成语里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00114",
      "start_ms": 339530,
      "end_ms": 340690,
      "text": "刻在历史里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00115",
      "start_ms": 340970,
      "end_ms": 343130,
      "text": "刻在每个中国人的记忆里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00116",
      "start_ms": 343290,
      "end_ms": 344330,
      "text": "名字没改，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00117",
      "start_ms": 344510,
      "end_ms": 345530,
      "text": "地位没降，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00118",
      "start_ms": 346070,
      "end_ms": 346910,
      "text": "位置没挪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00119",
      "start_ms": 347270,
      "end_ms": 347990,
      "text": "就这一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00120",
      "start_ms": 349010,
      "end_ms": 350970,
      "text": "您说这个第一名服不服？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00121",
      "start_ms": 351269,
      "end_ms": 352470,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00122",
      "start_ms": 352910,
      "end_ms": 356010,
      "text": "这十个地名没有一个是随便改的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00123",
      "start_ms": 356270,
      "end_ms": 362050,
      "text": "朝歌改旗县是因为境内有条齐河陈仓改宝鸡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00124",
      "start_ms": 362450,
      "end_ms": 364685,
      "text": "是因为唐玄宗做了一个梦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00125",
      "start_ms": 365180,
      "end_ms": 370145,
      "text": "常山改石家庄是因为石家庄村琅琊改临沂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00126",
      "start_ms": 370530,
      "end_ms": 376645,
      "text": "是因为靠近颐和兰陵改枣庄是因为附近有枣庄煤矿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00127",
      "start_ms": 377180,
      "end_ms": 380940,
      "text": "金陵改南京是为了区分南北幽州，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00128",
      "start_ms": 381020,
      "end_ms": 384715,
      "text": "改北京是为了突出北方的京城。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00129",
      "start_ms": 385220,
      "end_ms": 388195,
      "text": "广陵改扬州是因为古代九州。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00130",
      "start_ms": 388640,
      "end_ms": 395475,
      "text": "姑苏改苏州是因为姑苏山只有邯郸三千一百年没改过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00131",
      "start_ms": 395830,
      "end_ms": 398335,
      "text": "每一个地名都是一段历史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00132",
      "start_ms": 398600,
      "end_ms": 399815,
      "text": "改了就断了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00133",
      "start_ms": 400070,
      "end_ms": 400690,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_dd0d990eb31f1cb5_s00134",
      "start_ms": 400830,
      "end_ms": 402255,
      "text": "咱们下期接着聊。"
    }
  ],
